        "Natural scheduling into the typed origin 3795 is not established: 35M.MES is named only from FLOOR5.MES's opaque tail.",
        "What moves the I word banked_u16[203] and clears the eight flags (global_u8[130], global_u8[137], global_u8[134], global_u8[1259], global_u8[1301], global_u8[1339], global_u8[2624], global_u8[2083]) is not established -- the callee never writes the word.",
